id: pm-web-gbuc
title: Move pm-web's runtime dependency on pm CLI to 2026.9.23
description: "The 2026-09-25 fleet wave (pm-web#158) moved pm-ops and pm-changelog to 2026.9.23 but left @unbrained/pm-cli at 2026.9.21, because pm-web declares it under dependencies (it runs pm at request time) and the wave script only rewrote devDependencies. This moves the runtime dependency, the lockfile and manifest.json pm_min_version (tests require it to equal the pinned SDK) to 2026.9.23, which the hosted pm-web.unbrained.dev build then picks up. Tenant compatibility was checked on a private copy of all 31 hosted workspaces: identical item counts, id sets and health under 2026.9.21 and 2026.9.23. Companion epic pm-cli-website-5s6z."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: certify,hosted,pm-cli-2026.9.23
created_at: "2026-09-25T09:57:04.128Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-25T10:26:10.386Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-25T10:26:09.755Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-25T10:26:09.755Z"
author: claude-hub
acceptance_criteria: "package.json dependencies, package-lock.json and manifest.json pm_min_version all name 2026.9.23; release:check exits 0"
resolution: Moved the runtime pm CLI dependency to 2026.9.23
expected_result: pm-web runs pm 2026.9.23 at request time and its gates pass
actual_result: "release:check exits 0 with the 2026.9.23 runtime pin"
